    <title>孙燕姿演唱会，爬也要爬着去！Vol.26</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/682d569ffcbc2e206bfb1fc2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">682d569ffcbc2e206bfb1fc2</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 21 May 2025 04:30:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：少伟 戏剧人，小孟 媒体人</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：王周 前娱记</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj5LtMRZQkJ38hZqo9ebvIBOcRuC.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>“50万加仑的水</span></p><span></span><p><span>42kg的体重</span></p><span></span><p><span>88个琴键</span></p><span></span><p><span>24分钟车程</span></p><span></span><p><span>33转的LP</span></p><span></span><p><span>一个任性的我</span></p><span></span><p><span>一个离开的你”</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是孙燕姿的歌迷都懂的暗号</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间过去25年</span></p><span></span><p><span>孙燕姿在《就在日落以后》演唱会有了回应</span></p><span></span><p><span>“50公斤的体重</span></p><span></span><p><span>90位工作人员</span></p><span></span><p><span>7000个热情的你</span></p><span></span><p><span>一个任性的我”</span></p><span></span><p><span>在我们的共同记忆里</span></p><span></span><p><span>孙燕姿像是一个刻度</span></p><span></span><p><span>从少年到中年</span></p><span></span><p><span>她用歌声陪伴着我们</span></p><span></span><p><span>也记录了我们的青春</span></p><span></span><p><span>当“冷门歌手”要开演唱会</span></p><span></span><p><span>却轻松突破超百万人想看的记录</span></p><span></span><p><span>有歌迷带着孩子一起去见青春里的她</span></p><span></span><p><span>有歌迷即使腿脚骨折</span></p><span></span><p><span>也笑称“爬着也要去看孙燕姿”</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目</span></p><span></span><p><span>刚看完孙燕姿演唱会深圳站的我们</span></p><span></span><p><span>保留着最新鲜的感动</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起畅谈孙燕姿</span></p><span></span><p><span>及住在我们青春里的那些回声</span></p><span></span><p><span>谢谢孙燕姿</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝我们平日快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>也祝她开心</span></p><span></span><p><span>不止十年</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>#本期彩蛋</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>爬也要去听演唱会（图片已获本人同意）：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqNPPKHKTSk1wWPfKwXUg_WAPa8G.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>网友@半岛铁池</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmHJOzaOtKMptYT2L0OgHdG9N38o.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>来自少伟和小孟的现场图片：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fskfc8VOJmi4Wm2AWD_54GAHHhN2.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlPCDwQyQkEYY4OBNnaVaRMgG7Bw.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpQQ2WqP-aQcfLEI2txymYLt4sdP.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkDsIhs4tUH5S8ldVyGZoxHLu39t.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fipr2ex6AXikqSNNNo350CsPhc83.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>#本期BGM：孙燕姿《一样的夏天》《祝你开心》</span></p>]]></description>
